+# T4 attempt 1: route demo /documents, /content and demo-esg- paths to lane hooks
+
+## What changed
+- `internal/workiva/demo_client.go`: added `isDemoDocumentsPath` and `isDemoESGPath` predicates next to `isSheetsPath`. `RoundTrip` routes to `t.demoDocumentsResponse` and `t.demoESGResponse` directly after the token case and before every spreadsheet case. No struct fields added.
+- `internal/workiva/demo_documents.go` (new): `demoDocumentsResponse` returns a 404 JSON body `{"error":"demo report documents not served yet: <path>"}` built with encoding/json through a local helper `demoLaneHookNotFound`. Doc comment says L3 replaces the body.
+- `internal/workiva/demo_esg.go` (new): `demoESGResponse` returns a 404 JSON body `{"error":"demo ESG fixture not served yet: <path>"}` through its own local helper `demoESGNotFound`. Doc comment says L4 replaces the body.
+- `internal/workiva/demo_client_routes_test.go` (new): `TestDemoTransportRoutesLaneHooks`, table test over both predicates, plus GET `/spreadsheets` and GET `/spreadsheets/demo-sp-energy-2026/sheets` returning 200.
+- `internal/workiva/demo_documents_test.go` (new): `TestDemoDocumentsResponseNotFound`.
+- `internal/workiva/demo_esg_test.go` (new): `TestDemoESGResponseNotFound`.
+- Not touched: `demo_client_test.go`, go.mod, go.sum, any existing `*_test.go`, and the excluded packages.
+
+## Acceptance results
+- `go test ./internal/workiva/... -race -count=1`: PASS.
+- Verbose `-run` check for the three named tests: all three `--- PASS` lines present, including all subtests of `TestDemoTransportRoutesLaneHooks`.
+- `go vet ./internal/workiva/...`: clean.
+- `test -z "$(gofmt -l internal/workiva)"`: clean.
+- `git diff --diff-filter=MD --name-only 56b9f95 -- '*_test.go'`: empty, so no existing test files were modified or deleted.
+- `go build ./...`: OK.
+- Repo-wide `go test ./... -race -count=1`: all packages ok.
+- Repo-wide `gofmt -l .`, `go vet ./...` and `golangci-lint run`: clean (0 issues).
+
+## Decisions and notes
+- The ESG case sits before the spreadsheet cases in the switch, as the spec requires, so `/spreadsheets/demo-esg-*/sheets` never reaches `isSheetsPath`. Existing fixture routes for `demo-sp-*` are unaffected.
+- Each lane hook file has its own 404 helper, which keeps L3 and L4 from editing a shared helper. `demoNotFound` is unchanged.
+- No new module dependencies.
